    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use the [[/item Cunning Strike activity=\"Poison\"]]{Poison} option of your Cunning Strike, the target also takes [[/damage 2d6 poison]] damage whenever it fails the saving throw. This damage ignores Resistance to Poison damage.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-JI5zawKdS8pQDlYO\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Poison</strong> activity on this feature includes the save and poison damage.</p><p>Alternatively, you can use the inline roll above if you've already used the original activity.</p><p><strong>Important:</strong> This damage does not automatically bypass resistances so ensure the correct damage is being applied.</p></section>",
